data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-1", "text": "Drafted 'rb_sas_1inch_mounted' on a 485x225 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x half wave plate, 3x beam dump, 2x pbs, 1x sampler, 1x vapor cell, 1x photodiode. Rubidium D2 (780 nm) saturated-absorption spectroscopy setup using 1-inch mounted optics. An input laser beam passes through HWP1 and PBS1 to pick off a spectroscopy branch (V-polarized) while transmitting the main beam. Mirror M1 directs the branch d"}

