data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-2", "text": "Drafted 'rb_sas_1inch_mounted' on a 485x220 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x half wave plate, 3x beam dump, 2x pbs, 1x sampler, 1x vapor cell, 1x photodiode. Rubidium D2 (780 nm) saturated-absorption spectroscopy branch using 1-inch mounted optics. A half-wave plate (HWP1) and polarizing beamsplitter (PBS1) pick off a V-polarized branch toward mirror M1, while the transmitted main beam goes to a dump/downs"}

