data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "repair-1", "text": "Rationale: BD_pump_r was left unplaced on branch IN.r.t.r.r (because BS reflects a +x beam to +90 deg, which retraces into M1 and PBS1 rather than going down, so IN.r.t.r.r was absorbed at PBS1 before BD_pump_r could be placed, dropping an error blocker on PBS1-M1 that blocked all light) and the counter-propagating pump escaping PBS1's right port was unterminated; I removed BD_pump_r, shifted the "}

