ump dump (10% reflected by BS through M1 and PBS1)", "group": null, "part_number": "LB1", "beam": "IN.r.t.r.r.t", "distance_mm": 30.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}], "targets": [{"element_id": "PD", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 0.15}], "notes": "Snap geometry: IN at (445,30) dir 90 -> HWP1 at (445,110) -> PBS1 at (445,165). Reflected branch (V, 5 mW) goes left (180 deg) to M1 at (350,165), down (-90 deg) to BS at (350,125). Probe (10% R = 0.5 mW) goes left (180 deg) through HWP2 at (300,125) [fast_axis=45 deg rotates V->H] to M2 at (260,125), down to M3 at (260,85), left through CELL at (175,85) [T=0.65 -> 0.325 mW] and PBS2 at (95,85) to PD at (40,85). Pump (90% T = 4.5 mW, V) goes down to M4 at (350,45), left through HWP3 at (235,45) to M5 at (95,45), up to PBS2 at (95,85), where V reflects right (0 deg) through CELL, M3, M2, HWP2 (V->H), and BS to dumps BD_pump_t at (405,125) and BD_pump_r at (475,165) after transmitting through M1 and PBS1.", "logic": null}, "report": {"passed": true, "score": 95.08125, "checks": [{"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: PD: 0.325 mW (need \u2265 0.150)", "element_id": "PD", "segment_id": null, "value": 0.32499999999999996, "limit": 0.15}], "metrics": {"input_mw": 20.0, "delivered_mw": 0.32499999999999996, "dumped_mw": 17.925, "stray_mw": 0.0, "n_elements": 16.0, "n_segments": 24.0, "target.PD.min_power_mw": 0.32499999999999996, "delivered_fraction": 0.016249999999999997}}, "trace": {"segments": [{"id": "s0", "branch": "IN", "source_id": "IN", "start": [445.0, 30.0], "end": [445.0, 110.0], "direction_deg": 90.0, "length_mm": 80.0, 